1 REM FBCS SEG-0515
2 REM CLAIM A-9.2.2-TR134
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM 9.2.2 l.4522-4526, 12.1.4 l.8805-8807: the detached-handler of an EXTERNAL SUB is part of that unit;
5 REM its CALL to an external SUB is checked against the DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB of the unit, not against
6 REM those of the main program.
10 DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB E
20 CALL E
30 END
100 EXTERNAL SUB E
110 DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB LOG
120 WHEN EXCEPTION USE H
130   CAUSE EXCEPTION 5
140 END WHEN
150 HANDLER H
160   CALL LOG
170 END HANDLER
180 END SUB
200 EXTERNAL SUB LOG
210 PRINT "LOG"; EXTYPE
220 END SUB
